0..79 Comment "// Rust\'s default layout, as `std.layout` computes it, checked against rustc on"
80..96 Comment "// eleven types."
97..99 Comment "//"
100..178 Comment "// rustc is the authority on a Rust type\'s layout. The foreign boundary admits"
179..255 Comment "// an extern by the layouts the program computes, so the program agrees with"
256..285 Comment "// rustc wherever it answers."
286..288 Comment "//"
289..366 Comment "// Each layout below is what `rustc -Zprint-type-sizes` printed for the type,"
367..443 Comment "// and each `runs` re-checks it offline. The table after this head lists the"
444..526 Comment "// eleven types. A field that is itself an aggregate has no code yet, and its twin"
527..541 Comment "// is refused."
542..544 Comment "//"
545..621 Comment "// - see: #2343 — not implemented: a field that is itself an aggregate, an"
622..675 Comment "//   array or a zero-sized type, over levitated codes"
676..732 Comment "// - see: `library/std/src/layout.gandr` — the program"
733..812 Comment "// - see: `pathological/layouts/rust-default.gandr` — a struct field, refused"
814..890 Comment "// rustc 1.98.0-nightly (f28ac764c 2026-06-23) for x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu:"
891..893 Comment "//"
894..945 Comment "// | type | size | align | fields in memory order |"
946..974 Comment "// | --- | --- | --- | --- |"
975..1052 Comment "// | `struct Mixed { a: u8, b: u32, c: u16 }` | 8 | 4 | `b` 0, `c` 4, `a` 6 |"
1053..1129 Comment "// | `struct Wide { a: u8, b: u64, c: u8 }` | 16 | 8 | `b` 0, `a` 8, `c` 9 |"
1130..1192 Comment "// | `struct Small { x: u16, y: u8 }` | 4 | 2 | `x` 0, `y` 2 |"
1193..1273 Comment "// | `struct Flagged { a: u8, b: bool, c: u16 }` | 4 | 2 | `c` 0, `a` 2, `b` 3 |"
1274..1354 Comment "// | `struct Signed { a: i32, b: i64, c: u8 }` | 16 | 8 | `b` 0, `a` 8, `c` 12 |"
1355..1431 Comment "// | `enum MaybeRef { Some(&u32), None }` | 8 | 8 | niche at 0; `Some.0` 0 |"
1432..1508 Comment "// | `enum MaybeFlag { Set(bool), Unset }` | 1 | 1 | niche at 0; `Set.0` 0 |"
1509..1601 Comment "// | `enum Either { Left(u32), Right(u16) }` | 8 | 4 | 2-byte tag; `Left.0` 4, `Right.0` 2 |"
1602..1709 Comment "// | `enum Jagged { Full(u32, bool), Thin(u8) }` | 8 | 4 | 1-byte tag; `Full.1` 1, `Full.0` 4, `Thin.0` 1 |"
1710..1794 Comment "// | `enum ThreeRef { First, Held(&u32), Last }` | 16 | 8 | 8-byte tag; `Held.0` 8 |"
1795..1879 Comment "// | `enum ThreeFlag { First, Held(bool), Last }` | 1 | 1 | niche at 0; `Held.0` 0 |"
